{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-quote-followup#card-zh","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-quote-followup","commit":"9783fdf49ef1d893bb5ff815249c51e63cde6864","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quote-followup（DSH Web 插件）：选中对话内容并将其引用到输入框，便于围绕具体片段追问。它在 Web 对话文本选中后显示浮动引用按钮，通过当前会话的输入接口插入原生引用 chip；发送时 codec 将 chip 转为 Markdown 引用块，缺少原生能力时使用纯文本。支持连续引用、显示角色和可用轮次信息，并在输入框不可用时提示重试。适合需要针对长对话中的某段内容继续提问的 DSH Web 用户。需要将插件加入 Web profile 并重启服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:575-646","lib/client.js:199-215"]}
{"unit_id":"tr1v3r__dsh-quote-followup#card-en","repo":"tr1v3r/dsh-quote-followup","commit":"9783fdf49ef1d893bb5ff815249c51e63cde6864","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Quote selected DSH Web text in the composer for focused follow-ups. A floating button inserts a reference chip in the active session; sending expands it into a Markdown quote. Older hosts use plain text, with role and turn context when available. Add the plugin to the Web profile and restart DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:575-646","lib/client.js:199-215"]}
